# Nagad Static Information Extraction Audit
**Sources:** `data/stage-4/raw/bd-fn02-dom.html` (SSR DOM, Nuxt, BootstrapVue) + `data/stage-4/screenshots/bd-fn02-fullpage.png` + local static crops. Popup/hero/offer graphics are remote JPEGs (backend.nagad.com.bd), so their text is read from the full-page screenshot; all body text is confirmed verbatim from the DOM.

## 1. Header Branding & Global Affordances
**(a)** **Not Found (illegible in static snapshot).** The header logo is an image (`/_nuxt/img/new-logo.14fe8a5.png`, `alt=""`) with a tiny tagline line baked into the PNG beneath the "নগদ" wordmark. At snapshot resolution it renders at ~5–10 px tall; pixel-level zooms (up to 2000%) confirm the line exists but the glyphs cannot be transcribed with certainty. (The page body separately states Nagad is "বাংলাদেশ পোস্ট অফিসের একটি ডিএফএস", but that is a section heading, not the logo tagline.)
**(b)** **বাংলা (Bangla) is active.** In the pill-shaped language toggle ("English | বাংলা"), the active state is a **filled dark red/maroon rounded pill with white text** on "বাংলা"; "English" is inactive (plain dark text on the light translucent pill). Corroborated in DOM: logo link `href="/bn"` carries `aria-current="page"`, and all page content is rendered in Bangla.
**(c)** The sixth/final nav link: **"নগদ ইসলামিক"** (Nagad Islamic). Full order: সার্ভিসেস (dropdown) → সব অফার → ক্যারিয়ার → পরিচিতি → হেল্প (dropdown) → নগদ ইসলামিক.

