**(c)** A male athlete in a **red Bangladesh national cricket jersey** holding a smartphone showing the Nagad app. **Name: Not Found** — no identifying text exists in the DOM (`alt=""`) or any static asset.
**(d)** Primary action button: text **"Let's go"** + a right-arrow (→) icon. Styling (from CSS in the DOM): white pill button — `border-radius:100px`, `background:#fff`, `border:2px solid #fff`, `color:#d0392c`, `font-size:15px`, `padding:20px 32px`, flex row with a 24×24 px arrow icon (`margin-left:16px`); on hover: background/border become `#d0392c`, text and icon turn white.

